    "flavor_text_entries": [
      {
        "flavor_text": "Ce fauteur de troubles est doté d’anneaux qui déforment l’espace et lui permettent d’expédier au loin n’importe quel objet.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "x",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/23/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "This troublemaker sends anything and everything to faraway places using its loop, which can warp space.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "x",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/23/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "空間を　ゆがめる　リングで あらゆる　ものを　離れた　場所へ 飛ばしてしまう　トラブルメーカー。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "x",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/23/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il a la faculté de téléporter les choses en les faisant passer au travers de ses anneaux. Il envoie les objets qui lui plaisent dans une cachette connue de lui seul.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "y",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/24/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It gathers things it likes and passes them through its loop to teleport them to a secret place.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "y",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/24/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "気に入った　ものを　リングを　使い 秘密の　住処へ　集めている。 リングを　潜って　テレポートする。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "y",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/24/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il possède une puissance considérable sous son apparence véritable. Une légende raconte qu’il désirait si fort un trésor caché dans un château qu’il déroba l’édifice tout entier.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "omega-ruby",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/25/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "In its true form, it possess a huge amount of power. Legends of its avarice tell how it once carried off an entire castle to gain the treasure hidden within.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "omega-ruby",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/25/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "真の姿は　巨大な　力を　持っている。 財宝　欲しさに　それが　隠された　城ごと 引き抜き　奪い去った　という　伝説が　ある。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "omega-ruby",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/25/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "On raconte que grâce à ses six anneaux et ses six énormes bras, il est capable de dérober tout ce qui lui plaît. Mais son pouvoir a été scellé, et il a été réduit à l’état d’un être minuscule.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "alpha-sapphire",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/26/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It is said to be able to seize anything it desires with its six rings and six huge arms. With its power sealed, it is transformed into a much smaller form.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "alpha-sapphire",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/26/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "６つの　リングと　６つの　巨大な腕で あらゆるものを　奪うと　いわれる。 力を　封じられ　小さな姿に　変えられた。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "alpha-sapphire",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/26/"
        }
      }
